    <title>
        feat(azure): add Fast mode for priority-processing GPT models (#9192)
    </title>
    <updated>2026-10-09T03:14:03Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1549082?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>opencode-agent</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/opencode-agent</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat(azure): add Fast mode for priority-processing GPT models (#9192)

Azure priority processing is selected per request with service_tier=priority. Add experimental.modes.fast to the Azure GPT models that Microsoft documents as supporting priority processing and that have published Global Standard priority rates: GPT-5.1, GPT-5.2, GPT-5.4, GPT-5.4 mini, GPT-5.5, GPT-5.6 Sol and GPT-5.6 Terra.

Co-authored-by: rekram1-node &amp;lt;63023139+rekram1-node@users.noreply.github.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
